{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>To Molech.</b> It is an idolatry whose name is Molech, and this is its worship — that one hands over his son to the priests, and they make two great fires and pass the son with his feet between the two fires (Sanhedrin 64)." "<b>You shall not give.</b> This is the handing over to the priests." "<b>To pass to Molech.</b> This is the passing through the fire."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:59.784196042Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}